<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics (Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo))",
        "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics faithfully reproduces Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-drosophila-ventral-furrow-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py> ;
    schema:about "Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Full 3D anteroposterior germband-extension coupling or subcellular Rho1/Rok reaction-diffusion signaling cascades",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 64-cell 2D incompressible trapezoidal blastoderm ring simulator enclosed by the vitelline membrane (R_vit = 83.2 um, A_0 = 262.4 um^2), RK2 integration of ratcheted Myosin-II pulses, 6-regime biomechanical/mutant benchmark, and 15x15 (r_twist x sigma_synergy) morphospace",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Automated 4-stage confocal cross-section segmentation and ventral apical Myosin-II red enrichment analysis on drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg (DV/ML = 1.0496 -> 0.9217, MyoII enrichment = 1.63x, trajectory r = 0.9993)",
        "reported_in_source: Conte, Munoz, Baum & Miodownik (2012) PLoS ONE 7(11):e49973 2D incompressible finite-element cross-sectional decomposition showing apical constriction alone produces only a shallow groove (16.5 um) with over-elongated cells (48.1 um), whereas synergy with basal relaxation, lateral shortening, and ectodermal pushing drives full invagination (41.0 um)",
        "reported_in_source: Martin, Kaschube & Wieschaus (2009) Nature 457:495-499 Twist-stabilized ratcheted Myosin-II pulses (T_pulse = 82 s) vs unratcheted relaxation recoil, and He et al. (2014) Nature 508:392-396 hydrodynamic cytoplasmic cell elongation",
        "transfer_boundary: 2D transverse cross-sectional incompressible trapezoidal vertex-continuum ring calibrated to Conte et al. (2012) 2D FEA and Martin et al. (2009) / He et al. (2014) live confocal morphometrics" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py; output: docs/media/drosophila_ventral_furrow_comparison.png; organism: Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 472aac8153c8fe9cc40194b17fd78b655588c12f710d6e8a68aba7963971c58f; artifact_sha256: 08844a6e7b1fb107ab56e2044cf753c193fd1c53940818b9e442ec8cb8f25403; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_reference.json=5c6f1960cef1be19..., datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg=f426366f7ede436d..., datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/scout_manifest.json=0c6354ab1d934ba3...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-drosophila-ventral-furrow-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Conte, Munoz, Baum & Miodownik (2012) PLoS ONE 7(11):e49973 2D incompressible finite-element cross-sectional decomposition showing apical constriction alone produces only a shallow groove (16.5 um) with over-elongated cells (48.1 um), whereas synergy with basal relaxation, lateral shortening, and ectodermal pushing drives full invagination (41.0 um) | Martin, Kaschube & Wieschaus (2009) Nature 457:495-499 Twist-stabilized ratcheted Myosin-II pulses (T_pulse = 82 s) vs unratcheted relaxation recoil, and He et al. (2014) Nature 508:392-396 hydrodynamic cytoplasmic cell elongation; reconstructed_in_script: 64-cell 2D incompressible trapezoidal blastoderm ring simulator enclosed by the vitelline membrane (R_vit = 83.2 um, A_0 = 262.4 um^2), RK2 integration of ratcheted Myosin-II pulses, 6-regime biomechanical/mutant benchmark, and 15x15 (r_twist x sigma_synergy) morphospace | Automated 4-stage confocal cross-section segmentation and ventral apical Myosin-II red enrichment analysis on drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg (DV/ML = 1.0496 -> 0.9217, MyoII enrichment = 1.63x, trajectory r = 0.9993); transfer_boundary: 2D transverse cross-sectional incompressible trapezoidal vertex-continuum ring calibrated to Conte et al. (2012) 2D FEA and Martin et al. (2009) / He et al. (2014) live confocal morphometrics; does_not_claim: Full 3D anteroposterior germband-extension coupling or subcellular Rho1/Rok reaction-diffusion signaling cascades]" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bpj.2014.07.013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature07522>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature13070>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0049973> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-code-traceability>,
