<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements exact 2D cytoplasmic cell area conservation `A_i = 0.5*(w_ap + w_ba)*h_i = A_0 = 262.4 um^2`, RK2 integration of the Martin et al. (2009) Twist-stabilized ratcheted Myosin-II pulse ODE, two-phase He et al. (2014) hydrodynamic cell lengthening followed by Conte et al. (2012) basal relaxation + lateral shortening, and 64-cell polygonal blastoderm ring reconstruction (L97-445), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_046_drosophila_ventral_furrow.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 7 reference-anchored quantitative morphometric measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L623-745): wild-type synergistic furrow depth (41.0 um vs 41.0 ref), apical-only shallow groove depth (16.5 um vs 16.5 ref, cell height 48.1 um), 6-regime depth Pearson r = 1.0000 (cell height r = 1.0000), unratcheted recoil apical width (7.10 um vs 7.10 ref), twist;snail null control depth (0.0 um), specimen Stage 4 DV/ML aspect ratio (0.9217 vs 0.9239 ref), and 4-stage invagination trajectory correlation (r = 0.9993)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
