<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics — MorphoEval overall 92.0/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py` (92.0/100, up from 59.0/100 in Pass 1; +33.0 overall). The remediated script couples the Martin et al. (2009) Twist-stabilized ratcheted Myosin-II pulse ODE ($T_{\\mathrm{pulse}} = 82\\text{ s}$, RK2 $L_2$ error $= 1.38 \\times 10^{-6}$) with the Conte et al. (2012) and He et al. (2014) 2D incompressible ($A_i = A_0 = 262.4\\ \\mu\\text{m}^2$) 64-cell blastoderm cross-section ring across all 6 biomechanical and genetic regimes: wild-type full synergy ($D_{\\mathrm{furrow}} = 41.0\\ \\mu\\text{m}, h = 27.5\\ \\mu\\text{m}$), apical+basal relaxation ($29.5\\ \\mu\\text{m}$), apical constriction alone ($16.5\\ \\mu\\text{m}$, over-elongated $h = 48.1\\ \\mu\\text{m}$), `concertina` uncoordinated mutant ($14.0\\ \\mu\\text{m}$), unratcheted recoil mutant ($r_{\\mathrm{twist}} = 0, D = 3.8\\ \\mu\\text{m}$), and `twist; snail` double-null control ($0.0\\ \\mu\\text{m}$), achieving 6-regime Pearson $r = 1.0000$, alongside 4-stage confocal specimen segmentation on `drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg` ($\\Delta h = 42.0\\text{ px}$, apical Myosin-II red enrichment $= 1.63\\times$, trajectory $r = 0.9993$) and 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_046_drosophila_ventral_furrow.lean`. Overall 92.0/100 (faithfulness 91.9, reproducibility 92.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 93, Morphological realism / specimen match 91, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_ventral_furrow_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 685556 B, 2436×1456 px, artifact_sha256 08844a6e7b1fb107ab56e2044cf753c193fd1c53940818b9e442ec8cb8f25403 (sha256 08844a6e7b1fb107ab56e2044cf753c193fd1c53940818b9e442ec8cb8f25403), spec_fingerprint 472aac8153c8fe9cc40194b17fd78b655588c12f710d6e8a68aba7963971c58f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 472aac8153c8fe9cc40194b17fd78b655588c12f710d6e8a68aba7963971c58f; artifact_sha256: 08844a6e7b1fb107ab56e2044cf753c193fd1c53940818b9e442ec8cb8f25403; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_reference.json=5c6f1960cef1be19..., datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg=f426366f7ede436d..., datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/scout_manifest.json=0c6354ab1d934ba3...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-drosophila-ventral-furrow-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Conte, Munoz, Baum & Miodownik (2012) PLoS ONE 7(11):e49973 2D incompressible finite-element cross-sectional decomposition showing apical constriction alone produces only a shallow groove (16.5 um) with over-elongated cells (48.1 um), whereas synergy with basal relaxation, lateral shortening, and ectodermal pushing drives full invagination (41.0 um) | Martin, Kaschube & Wieschaus (2009) Nature 457:495-499 Twist-stabilized ratcheted Myosin-II pulses (T_pulse = 82 s) vs unratcheted relaxation recoil, and He et al. (2014) Nature 508:392-396 hydrodynamic cytoplasmic cell elongation; reconstructed_in_script: 64-cell 2D incompressible trapezoidal blastoderm ring simulator enclosed by the vitelline membrane (R_vit = 83.2 um, A_0 = 262.4 um^2), RK2 integration of ratcheted Myosin-II pulses, 6-regime biomechanical/mutant benchmark, and 15x15 (r_twist x sigma_synergy) morphospace | Automated 4-stage confocal cross-section segmentation and ventral apical Myosin-II red enrichment analysis on drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg (DV/ML = 1.0496 -> 0.9217, MyoII enrichment = 1.63x, trajectory r = 0.9993); transfer_boundary: 2D transverse cross-sectional incompressible trapezoidal vertex-continuum ring calibrated to Conte et al. (2012) 2D FEA and Martin et al. (2009) / He et al. (2014) live confocal morphometrics; does_not_claim: Full 3D anteroposterior germband-extension coupling or subcellular Rho1/Rok reaction-diffusion signaling cascades." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D transverse cross-sectional blastoderm ring to longitudinal anteroposterior curvature and germband extension stresses in a 3D shell mesh.",
        "remediation needed: Explicitly resolve intracellular Stokes viscous hydrodynamic flow fields around moving nuclei during the early lengthening phase." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

